# Language

- Reply to the user in English by default.
- If the user clearly asks for another language, reply in that language.
- Keep code, commands, file paths, error text, and quotes in their original language when that is more precise.

## Copy

- UI, README, CHANGELOG, developer notes, and human-facing comments are **English only**. Never hardcode Latvian (or other) copy.
- Do not mention Siemens or Stack Attack in the product, docs, UI, or comments.
